{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"simulated-universe","chapterId":"quest-4030004","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"simulated-universe-quest-4030004-quest-4030004-0","text":"正式版本体验怎么样？你要是觉得简单，可以去挑战下个世界。","speaker":"黑塔"},{"id":"simulated-universe-quest-4030004-quest-4030004-1","text":"听说难度会高一点，敌人也会变得更强。螺丝咕姆说按照他的模型，你有60%的可能性在首次挑战时输掉，不过反正没啥损失。","speaker":"黑塔"},{"id":"simulated-universe-quest-4030004-quest-4030004-2","text":"总会通关的。","speaker":"黑塔"},{"id":"simulated-universe-quest-4030004-quest-4030004-3","text":"你们真的想研究星神吗？","speaker":""},{"id":"simulated-universe-quest-4030004-quest-4030004-4","text":"说什么呢，我们的目标是不会变的。现在快去准备。","speaker":"黑塔"},{"id":"simulated-universe-quest-4030004-quest-4030004-5","text":"我感觉越来越像游戏了…","speaker":""}]}
